  "title": "Salsafied Chicken and Rice",
  "description": "A delicious combination of chicken, salsa, and rice. Instant rice makes cooking this one-skillet meal quick and easy. Top it with melted Cheddar.",
  "authors": [
    "Jamey Corrin"
  ],
